-- החלטת ועדת מעקב (15.9.2013, registered 248/2013): the follow-up
-- committee, under §160 of the base agreement of 25.12.2008, adds §39א to
-- that agreement — a role allowance for the ICT coordinator of 6% of the
-- combined salary in a primary school and 8% in a junior high, computed
-- and paid by the rules of the subject coordinator's allowance (§39), with
-- §39(ב) (two allowances at most) and §39(ב1) (only while the role is
-- held) applying to it; gives a teacher off the reform's terms the same
-- rates, by the rules of a subject coordinator off the reform; from the
-- school year תשע"ד; and exhausts the parties' claims.
--
-- It adds to §39, so it imports §39 (`the role rate`, `the role
-- allowance`, `role allowances payable at most`), §39(ב1) as the
-- completion agreement of 29.2.2012 added it (`paid the role's
-- allowance`), and §160. A subject coordinator's allowance off the reform
-- is not encoded: it is a named input.

IMPORT prelude
IMPORT conventions
IMPORT parties
IMPORT `base-agreement-common`
IMPORT `base-agreement-39`
IMPORT `base-agreement-160`
IMPORT `2012-02-29_ofek-hadash_amendment_hascam-hashlama`

-- What the parties may not do under this decision.
DECLARE `decision 248/2013 action` IS ONE OF `raise a further claim on a matter decision 248/2013 settles`

§ `החלטת ועדת המעקב 248/2013 — גמול תפקיד לרכז תקשוב — 15.9.2013`

-- akn:preamble The decision's frame: a label row with no text of its own.
-- akn:preamble/p1 The registration stamp: registered as a collective agreement on 6.1.2014, number 248/2013; no rule.
-- akn:preamble/p2 A fax header; no rule.
-- akn:preamble/p3 The Treasury's filing mark at the foot of the page; no rule.
-- akn:preamble/p4 The title, with the date; no rule.

-- The opening: the follow-up committee decides under §160 of the base
-- agreement on a role allowance for the ICT coordinator. §160(ב)–(ג): the
-- supreme committee is the wages commissioner, the Ministry's
-- director-general and the union's secretary-general, and decides
-- unanimously; the sign-off names two of the three
-- (F-ofek-hadash-vaadat-maakav-248-2013-a). The reading adopted: the
-- decision binds as the committee's, the State and the union having signed
-- it and the registrar having registered it.
@ref akn:preamble/p5 akn:conclusions/p2 akn:conclusions/p3
`the signatories of decision 248/2013` MEANS
    LIST `the wages commissioner at the Treasury`, `the teachers' union`

`decision 248/2013 lacks a §160 member's signature` MEANS
    NOT all (GIVEN m YIELD elem m `the signatories of decision 248/2013`) `the supreme committee's members`

#ASSERT `decision 248/2013 lacks a §160 member's signature`

§§ `1 הוספת סעיף 39א להסכם הכולל — גמול תפקיד לרכז תקשוב`

-- §39א(א): a teacher who is an ICT coordinator is paid a role allowance of
-- 6% of the combined salary in a primary school and 8% in a junior high.
-- No rate is printed for another stage: NOTHING.
@ref akn:art_1
GIVEN s IS A `school stage`
GIVETH A MAYBE NUMBER
DECIDE `the ICT coordinator rate` s IS
    BRANCH
        IF s EQUALS `a primary school`     THEN JUST (6%)
        IF s EQUALS `a junior high school` THEN JUST (8%)
        OTHERWISE NOTHING

-- §39א(ב): the rules of computing and paying it are the subject
-- coordinator's (§39): the rate is taken of the base the subject
-- coordinator's allowance of the same stage is taken of — the full-position
-- combined salary, so long as the teacher holds a third of a position or
-- more (§39(א)(11) ¶2).
GIVEN s IS A `school stage`, c IS AN `allowance case`
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `the ICT coordinator allowance` s c IS
    CONSIDER `the ICT coordinator rate` s
    WHEN JUST r THEN r TIMES (`the role allowance` (`subject coordinator` s) c DIVIDED BY `the role rate` (`subject coordinator` s))
    WHEN NOTHING THEN 0

-- §39א(ג): §39(ב) — two role allowances at most, three with the district
-- manager's approval, the special-education allowance not counted — and
-- §39(ב1) — paid only while the role is held — apply to it. The ICT
-- allowance is one of the role allowances §39(ב) counts, and the two
-- highest are paid (as §39(ב) is read there, convention amounts.highest).
GIVEN c IS AN `allowance case`
      `approved by the district manager` IS A BOOLEAN
      roles IS A LIST OF `role`
      s IS A `school stage`
      `holds the ICT coordinator role` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `the role allowances paid, the ICT coordinator's among them` c `approved by the district manager` roles s `holds the ICT coordinator role` IS
        sum (map (GIVEN r YIELD `the role allowance` r c) (filter `a special-education allowance` roles))
    PLUS sum (take (`role allowances payable at most` `approved by the district manager`)
                   (sortBy (GIVEN a, b YIELD a AT LEAST b)
                           (append (map (GIVEN r YIELD `the role allowance` r c)
                                        (filter (GIVEN r YIELD NOT `a special-education allowance` r) roles))
                                   (IF `paid the role's allowance` `holds the ICT coordinator role`
                                    THEN LIST (`the ICT coordinator allowance` s c)
                                    ELSE EMPTY))))

-- A placeholder full-time junior-high teacher on a combined salary of
-- 10,000: the ICT allowance is 800, as a junior-high subject coordinator's
-- is; with a homeroom (10%) and a road-safety coordination (6%), the two
-- highest are the homeroom's and the ICT's.
`a junior-high teacher on 10,000` MEANS
    `allowance case` WITH
        `full-position combined salary`              IS 10000
        `position fraction`                          IS 1
        `frontal hours`                              IS 23
        `frontal hours in special-education classes` IS 0

#ASSERT `the ICT coordinator allowance` `a junior high school` `a junior-high teacher on 10,000` EQUALS 800
#ASSERT `the ICT coordinator allowance` `a primary school` `a junior-high teacher on 10,000` EQUALS 600
#ASSERT `the ICT coordinator allowance` `the grades from the tenth up` `a junior-high teacher on 10,000` EQUALS 0
#ASSERT `the role allowances paid, the ICT coordinator's among them` `a junior-high teacher on 10,000` FALSE (LIST `homeroom teacher`, `road-safety coordinator`) `a junior high school` TRUE EQUALS 1800
#ASSERT `the role allowances paid, the ICT coordinator's among them` `a junior-high teacher on 10,000` FALSE (LIST `homeroom teacher`, `road-safety coordinator`) `a junior high school` FALSE EQUALS 1600
-- Below a third of a position, nothing, as for a subject coordinator.
#ASSERT `the ICT coordinator allowance` `a junior high school` (`allowance case` WITH `full-position combined salary` IS 10000, `position fraction` IS 0.3, `frontal hours` IS 7, `frontal hours in special-education classes` IS 0) EQUALS 0

§§ `2 רכז תקשוב שאינו מועסק בתנאי הרפורמה`

-- A teacher off the reform's terms who is an ICT coordinator is paid the
-- allowance at the rates §39א sets for the reform, by the rules of
-- computing and paying a subject coordinator's allowance off the reform
-- (not encoded here; an input that takes the rate).
@ref akn:art_2
ASSUME `a subject coordinator's allowance off the reform, at the rate` IS A FUNCTION FROM NUMBER TO NUMBER

GIVEN s IS A `school stage`
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `the ICT coordinator allowance off the reform` s IS
    CONSIDER `the ICT coordinator rate` s
    WHEN JUST r THEN `a subject coordinator's allowance off the reform, at the rate` r
    WHEN NOTHING THEN 0

§§ `3 תחילה`

-- From the school year תשע"ד, which opens on 1.9.2013 (convention
-- dates.school-year).
@ref akn:art_3
GIVEN d IS A DATE
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `decision 248/2013 is in force on` d IF
    d `is on or after` (`the school year opening in` 2013)

#ASSERT `decision 248/2013 is in force on` (DATE_FROM_DMY 1 9 2013)
#ASSERT NOT `decision 248/2013 is in force on` (DATE_FROM_DMY 31 8 2013)

§§ `4 מיצוי תביעות`

-- The decision exhausts every claim of the parties on what it settles.
@ref akn:art_4
`no further claims under decision 248/2013` MEANS
    (PARTY `the State`
     SHANT `raise a further claim on a matter decision 248/2013 settles`)
    RAND
    (PARTY `the teachers' union`
     SHANT `raise a further claim on a matter decision 248/2013 settles`)

-- akn:conclusions The sign-off: a label row with no text of its own.
-- akn:conclusions/p1 The signatures; no rule.
